1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Hi, I'm an AI presenter,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,300
and this is SongScribe AI.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,300
Some moments deserve more than a card.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,700
SongScribe turns your story
into an original song,

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,700
with music, lyrics and vocals,

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,700
built from a guided brief.

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,700
Tell its AI Producer about a birthday,

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,100
a wedding or someone you miss,

9
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,100
by chat or by voice.

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:25,100
It shows the cost before spending credits,

11
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:29,100
then returns two variations,
typically in thirty to sixty seconds.

12
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,500
Creators use it for
intros and theme music.

13
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,700
Brands use it for jingles,

14
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,700
sonic logos and campaign soundtracks.

15
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,900
Genres run from acoustic and
gospel to Afrobeat and Amapiano,

16
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,900
and lyrics can blend English,

17
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,100
pidgin and Yoruba.

18
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:47,900
The rules are clear: no
copyrighted lyrics or melodies,

19
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,500
and no artist sound-alikes.

20
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:53,300
Start free, then choose a
personal or commercial licence.

21
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,900
Your story, turned into a song.
